    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "DUNCAN 3 independent sandbox design branch.\n\nAdds only the written design spec for SALVADOR SHADOW LEARNING R01.\n\nScope:\n- one-way/read-only shadow observer relative to production;\n- versioned measurements;\n- append-only learning events and artifact provenance;\n- categorical skill-state math and structured progress delta;\n- failure learning without design-authority inheritance;\n- authority-gated rule lifecycle;\n- reuse of HQ Memory/Search architecture from #144;\n- vertical acceptance scenarios before implementation.\n\nLinked design gate: #161.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION = NOT STARTED\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_MUTATION = NO\nCANON_MUTATION = NO\nAUTO_PROMOTION = NO",
